   "id": "seventh-frequency",
   "chapter": "ch14",
   "title": "How common are the diatonic seventh chords?",
   "kind": "concept",
   "summary": "V7 (Mm7) is the most frequent seventh chord, ii7 (m7) or iiø7 (dm7) the next most frequent, and viiø7 (vii°7) less frequent.",
   "sources": {
    "notes": "p.34",
    "textbook": "Aldwell, Schachter & Cadwallader, Harmony and Voice Leading 5e, Unit 13",
    "textbook2": "Burstein & Straus, Concise Introduction to Tonal Harmony 2e, Ch. 18"
   },
   "verification": {
